{
  "$format": "janus-conformance-case/1",
  "id": "facade/pact-jvm-bodies",
  "category": "facade",
  "facade": "pact-jvm",
  "title": "Each body pact-jvm's builders take is served as the test sends it and recorded as its pact converts.",
  "covers": [],
  "rows": [
    {
      "note": "Documentation/consumer-test-migration.md",
      "row": "`body(...)`: a `DslPart`, a `String` with a content type or without, an XML `Document`; `bodyWithSingleQuotes`"
    },
    { "note": "Documentation/consumer-test-migration.md", "row": "`body(FormPostBuilder)`" },
    { "note": "Documentation/consumer-test-migration.md", "row": "`body(PactXmlBuilder)`" },
    { "note": "Documentation/consumer-test-migration.md", "row": "`withBinaryData(bytes, contentType)`" },
    {
      "note": "Documentation/consumer-test-migration.md",
      "row": "`bodyMatchingContentType(contentType, example)`"
    }
  ],
  "why": "consumer-test-migration.md, pact-jvm: `body` with a `DslPart`, a `String` with a content type or without, an XML `Document`, and `bodyWithSingleQuotes`, are the same; a form body has its rules by parameter (ADR 0038); a `PactXmlBuilder` body is XML (ADR 0039); binary data is served and recorded as octets; `bodyMatchingContentType` is `content-type`, checked against the octets (ADR 0049), at each value of a JSON example, as pact-jvm's rule at `$` reaches them.",
  "note": "pact-jvm's builders declare a JSON, XML or form body's charset, ISO-8859-1 for XML and forms as HttpCore's types do, and its mock requires it, as the facade's does: the test sends it.",
  "subjects": { "jvm": "PactJvmBodies.java" },
  "expect": {
    "tests": [{ "test": "sendsEachBody" }],
    "contracts": {
      "web-app-orders-api.janus.json": {
        "content": {
          "interactions": [
            {
              "description": "get JSON of its content type",
              "parts": {
                "request": {
                  "method": { "example": "GET", "shape": "equality" },
                  "path": { "example": "/typed", "shape": "equality" }
                },
                "response": {
                  "body": {
                    "members": {
                      "sku": { "content-type": "application/json", "example": "A-1", "shape": "content-type" }
                    },
                    "shape": "object"
                  },
                  "headers": {
                    "members": {
                      "content-type": {
                        "entries": [
                          {
                            "shape": "http:media-type",
                            "type": "application/json",
                            "example": "application/json"
                          }
                        ],
                        "shape": "array"
                      }
                    },
                    "shape": "object"
                  },
                  "status": { "example": 200, "shape": "equality" }
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "description": "post JSON in single quotes",
              "parts": {
                "request": {
                  "body": { "members": { "sku": { "example": "A-1", "shape": "equality" } }, "shape": "object" },
                  "headers": {
                    "members": {
                      "content-type": {
                        "of": {
                          "entries": [
                            {
                              "example": "application/json",
                              "pattern": "^\\s*(?i:application)/(?:[^;]*\\+)?(?i:json)\\s*(?:;.*)?$",
                              "shape": "regex"
                            }
                          ],
                          "shape": "array"
                        },
                        "shape": "optional"
                      }
                    },
                    "shape": "object"
                  },
                  "method": { "example": "POST", "shape": "equality" },
                  "path": { "example": "/quoted", "shape": "equality" }
                },
                "response": { "status": { "example": 201, "shape": "equality" } }
              }
            },
            {
              "description": "post a DslPart",
              "parts": {
                "request": {
                  "body": { "members": { "sku": { "example": "A-1", "shape": "type" } }, "shape": "object" },
                  "headers": {
                    "members": {
                      "content-type": {
                        "entries": [
                          {
                            "shape": "http:media-type",
                            "type": "application/json; charset=UTF-8",
                            "example": "application/json; charset=UTF-8"
                          }
                        ],
                        "shape": "array"
                      }
                    },
                    "shape": "object"
                  },
                  "method": { "example": "POST", "shape": "equality" },
                  "path": { "example": "/dsl", "shape": "equality" }
                },
                "response": { "status": { "example": 201, "shape": "equality" } }
              }
            },
            {
              "description": "post a JSON string",
              "parts": {
                "request": {
                  "body": { "members": { "sku": { "example": "A-1", "shape": "equality" } }, "shape": "object" },
                  "headers": {
                    "members": {
                      "content-type": {
                        "of": {
                          "entries": [
                            {
                              "example": "application/json",
                              "pattern": "^\\s*(?i:application)/(?:[^;]*\\+)?(?i:json)\\s*(?:;.*)?$",
                              "shape": "regex"
                            }
                          ],
                          "shape": "array"
                        },
                        "shape": "optional"
                      }
                    },
                    "shape": "object"
                  },
                  "method": { "example": "POST", "shape": "equality" },
                  "path": { "example": "/json", "shape": "equality" }
                },
                "response": { "status": { "example": 201, "shape": "equality" } }
              }
            },
            {
              "description": "post a built XML body",
              "parts": {
                "request": {
                  "body": {
                    "members": {
                      "order": {
                        "members": {
                          "#trimmed": { "shape": "forbidden" },
                          "sku": {
                            "entries": [
                              {
                                "members": { "#trimmed": { "example": "A-1", "shape": "equality" } },
                                "shape": "object"
                              }
                            ],
                            "shape": "array"
                          }
                        },
                        "shape": "object"
                      }
                    },
                    "shape": "object"
                  },
                  "headers": {
                    "members": {
                      "content-type": {
                        "entries": [
                          {
                            "shape": "http:media-type",
                            "type": "application/xml; charset=ISO-8859-1",
                            "example": "application/xml; charset=ISO-8859-1"
                          }
                        ],
                        "shape": "array"
                      }
                    },
                    "shape": "object"
                  },
                  "method": { "example": "POST", "shape": "equality" },
                  "path": { "example": "/xml", "shape": "equality" }
                },
                "response": { "status": { "example": 201, "shape": "equality" } }
              }
            },
            {
              "description": "post a form",
              "parts": {
                "request": {
                  "body": {
                    "members": {
                      "quantity": { "entries": [{ "example": "2", "shape": "equality" }], "shape": "array" },
                      "sku": {
                        "entries": [{ "example": "A-1", "pattern": "^(?:[A-Z]-\\d+)$", "shape": "regex" }],
                        "shape": "array"
                      }
                    },
                    "shape": "object"
                  },
                  "headers": {
                    "members": {
                      "content-type": {
                        "entries": [
                          {
                            "shape": "http:media-type",
                            "type": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded; charset=ISO-8859-1",
                            "example": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded; charset=ISO-8859-1"
                          }
                        ],
                        "shape": "array"
                      }
                    },
                    "shape": "object"
                  },
                  "method": { "example": "POST", "shape": "equality" },
                  "path": { "example": "/form", "shape": "equality" }
                },
                "response": { "status": { "example": 201, "shape": "equality" } }
              }
            },
            {
              "description": "post an XML document",
              "parts": {
                "request": {
                  "body": {
                    "members": {
                      "order": {
                        "members": {
                          "@id": { "example": "1", "shape": "equality" },
                          "#trimmed": { "shape": "forbidden" }
                        },
                        "shape": "object"
                      }
                    },
                    "shape": "object"
                  },
                  "headers": {
                    "members": {
                      "content-type": {
                        "entries": [
                          {
                            "shape": "http:media-type",
                            "type": "application/xml; charset=ISO-8859-1",
                            "example": "application/xml; charset=ISO-8859-1"
                          }
                        ],
                        "shape": "array"
                      }
                    },
                    "shape": "object"
                  },
                  "method": { "example": "POST", "shape": "equality" },
                  "path": { "example": "/document", "shape": "equality" }
                },
                "response": { "status": { "example": 201, "shape": "equality" } }
              }
            },
            {
              "description": "post binary data",
              "parts": {
                "request": {
                  "body": {
                    "content-type": "application/octet-stream",
                    "encoded": "base64",
                    "example": "AQID",
                    "shape": "content-type"
                  },
                  "headers": {
                    "members": {
                      "content-type": {
                        "entries": [
                          {
                            "shape": "http:media-type",
                            "type": "application/octet-stream",
                            "example": "application/octet-stream"
                          }
                        ],
                        "shape": "array"
                      }
                    },
                    "shape": "object"
                  },
                  "method": { "example": "POST", "shape": "equality" },
                  "path": { "example": "/binary", "shape": "equality" }
                },
                "response": { "status": { "example": 201, "shape": "equality" } }
              }
            },
            {
              "description": "post text with its type",
              "parts": {
                "request": {
                  "body": { "example": "sku=A-1", "shape": "equality" },
                  "headers": {
                    "members": {
                      "content-type": {
                        "entries": [{ "shape": "http:media-type", "type": "text/plain", "example": "text/plain" }],
                        "shape": "array"
                      }
                    },
                    "shape": "object"
                  },
                  "method": { "example": "POST", "shape": "equality" },
                  "path": { "example": "/text", "shape": "equality" }
                },
                "response": { "status": { "example": 201, "shape": "equality" } }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
